<title>USA: Chesterfield Cty, S.C., won by Robinson Humphrey.</title>
<headline>Chesterfield Cty, S.C., won by Robinson Humphrey.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robinson Humphrey Co Inc, said it won $2.400 million of Chesterfield Cty, S.C., general obligation bonds, 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.36 percent.</p>
<p>AMT: 2,400,000	DATE: 01/30/97	NYC Time: 1200	CUSIP: 166357</p>
<p>ISSUER: Chesterfield Co						 ST: SC</p>
